<title>NETHERLANDS: ING BARINGS LOWERS CSM EPS ESTIMATES.</title>
<headline>ING BARINGS LOWERS CSM EPS ESTIMATES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of May 16 research</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker-----</p>
<p>    CSM		 Foods	   111.00  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: The 8.1 percent rise in profits in the six-months</p>
<p>to end-March to 101.1 million guilders was disappointing. Shows</p>
<p>CSM mainly active in mature markets. Estimates cut but at a</p>
<p>Relative PER of 107 percent for 1998, maintained as a Hold.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS</p>
<p>    1996/97	     5.50    5.65</p>
<p>    1997/98	     6.05    6.20</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 504)</p>
